<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 14-day T-bonds sell at 3.7742 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 14-day T-bonds sell at 3.7742 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank said on Monday it had sold 2.1 billion naira worth of 14-day treasury bonds at a weighted average rate of 3.7742 percent.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 5.8 billion naira and the true yield will be 3.002 percent.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank sold 16.4 billion naira worth of 10-day treasury bonds at a true yield of 3.002 percent.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira) (( --Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17))</p>
